{"reviews":[{"id":"B005FMUBLG-0","r":1.0,"t":"Completely Flimsy and NOT worth the cost","x":"For this kind of money it's not worth it. Think zip lock bags and you'll do better than this. So painfully flimsy in trim and clear material.  Don't you get ripped off also.  I purchased at the same time the Lexie clear PVC handbag Purse cosmetic container by bag manager and it was more substantial and worth the price. I also purchased the large clear zipper tot by Sachs and such and was pleased with that purchase.","h":23,"v":1,"d":"May 2013"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-1","r":2.0,"t":"bummer","x":"I think this product doesnt have enough thickness or suport. It looks floppy or saggy when full of stuff or empty. wont buy again.","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2012"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-2","r":3.0,"t":"Train Bag","x":"It holds a lot for women who have a lot of makeup. The only problem i have is the the plastic is two thing. So you can not put anything heavy inside of the bag.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2013"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-3","r":5.0,"t":"Was a present for my Mother","x":"I picked this bag so my Mother could put her medicines in and be able to carry them to her Doctors appointments.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2013"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-4","r":5.0,"t":"Was a present for my Mother","x":"I picked this bag so my Mother could put her medicines in and be able to carry them to her Doctors appointments.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2013"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-5","r":5.0,"t":"Was a present for my Mother","x":"I picked this bag so my Mother could put her medicines in and be able to carry them to her Doctors appointments.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2013"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-6","r":1.0,"t":"Garbage","x":"Don't waste the 6 bucks- the zipper was off the runner of the flimsy, single stitched runner.  The kicker is that there are NO RETURNS ON THIS ITEM, which is unusual for Amazon. I could have just thrown the money in the trashcan earlier instead of going through the hassles and still throwing this bag into the trashcan.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-7","r":5.0,"t":"Good bag","x":"This is a good bag for cosmetics, medical supplies, medications, supplements..... the best part is you can see what you have without opening it.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2013"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-8","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Not happy but than again i didn't pay much for this.  Handle already came off.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2014"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-9","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"it came already with a tear in it cheaply made","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2014"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-10","r":4.0,"t":"I like this but...","x":"Since it is plastic sewn to fabric, it will be prone to ripping (especially if you walk like i do and do exactly &#34;cradle&#34; it) the handles started to rip first now there's a small rip on the side. But I just used clear packing tape and it's pretty much as good as new. Oh the zipper snapper so I added a paper clip to it so i can comfortably zip it. But for 5 dollars it was a really good buy and serves its purpose of holding my work stuff nicely","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2013"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-11","r":5.0,"t":"it does the trick and didnt break on me","x":"I recently traveled to europe and purchased this bag specifically for the trip. It did what any normal bag should do - hold sh%@$t in place!! It was pretty big too, held a large tube of tooth paste, 2 tooth brushes, shampoo and conditioner (regular sized) and a stick of deoderant. Even with that, 10 days of travel, the case is still in one piece. WOuld def recommend it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2012"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-12","r":4.0,"t":"Perfect Size and Feel","x":"I really like the size and feel of this bag. It is the perfect size - not too big but holds quite a bit. There were no odors upon delivery - nice! Only flaw is that the zipper is on the flimsy side - so much so that I don't expect it to last... hopefully, it surprises me.  A bit taller and decent zipper would have made this bag near perfect.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2014"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-13","r":1.0,"t":"The worst bag possible","x":"The worst bag possible!! I just got it and the zipper wasn't even sewn on correctly!! I tried to open it and the stupid bag ripped! Don't waste your money like I did. Go to a dollar store they sell the same quality but the zipper is actually on correctly.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2015"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-14","r":1.0,"t":"Cheap and cheaply made....","x":"If I could give zero stars, I would. The zipper broke the first time I tried to open it.  Threw it away immediately. A Ziploc bag would (and did) work better. It is not worth the money paid (which wasn't much).  Don't waste a dime on this.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2015"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-15","r":2.0,"t":"Very thin vinyl, shapeless.","x":"Did not like, will not reorder. Very very thin vinyl. Don't recommend, ESpecially for the money. Disappointed!! Poor quality. I got different shape bag also which was same thin quality. I do not recommend this product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2012"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-16","r":1.0,"t":"Too cheaply made.You can't expect to last.","x":"If I could give less than 1star I would.the plastic is very lite and the zipper has been a pain since I got it at the end of July. 3 mos later zipper is broken. I expected a little more than that.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2015"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-17","r":5.0,"t":"Train Case","x":"Speedy delivery Excellent packing I did not read close enough regarding size. It is not the size of a traditional train case But it is very good as a cosmetic case or for organizing","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2016"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-18","r":1.0,"t":"Don't waste your money","x":"The zipper broke once I filled my bag with 3 items. Glad it happen at home instead of my trip. Don't waste your money.the plastic is super thin.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-19","r":3.0,"t":"Its just a bag","x":"Realy didnt care much for this bag. Cant realy say i like or dislike this bag. its just a bag and good for keeping cosmetics.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2013"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-20","r":1.0,"t":"2Small 2Thin","x":"I was disappointed because I imagined a larger size and better quality.  When one breaks I'll use the other.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great for nail polishes","x":"I bought it to hold my nail polish. It;s nice that it's see through. . . . . . .","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2013"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-22","r":3.0,"t":"Need to actually see what's for lunch","x":"This is a very interesting product for those who have to display contents at certain locations that require you to do so. It's simple see through design allow easy and accessible viewing to your contents. Great product is ideal for the warehouse or plant environment","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2013"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-23","r":3.0,"t":"BEST FOR STORING THINGS AS ZIPPER IS A LITTLE STICKY AT THE CORNERS","x":"It's a medium/small bag of soft plastic and is great for storing something you want to be able to see but not great for regular use as the zipper isn't particular user friendly. It seems sturdy enough, just that you will not enjoy opening and closing it regularly.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2014"},{"id":"B005FMUBLG-24","r":5.0,"t":"great organizer","x":"Heavy duty plastic. I am not worried about this bag not standing up to a heavy load.  I need to carry a clear bag into my retail job and this is the perfect size to keep my lunch, etc. I like that it is wide so my lunch won't tip over and spill in the bag.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2012"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the bag flimsy and cheaply made, with thin plastic and weak construction.","cites":[1,2,3,7,10,14,15]},{"text":"The zipper is a common point of failure, with several reviewers reporting it broke, was mis-sewn, or feels flimsy.","cites":[7,11,13,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers report durability problems like handles coming off or the bag tearing.","cites":[9,10,11,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers are satisfied with the bag for holding cosmetics, medications, or travel items, and like being able to see contents.","cites":[4,5,6,8,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise the size, noting it holds quite a bit while not being too big.","cites":[3,12,13]}]},"qa":[]}